# Project conventions

Before generating, editing, or reviewing code, read `AGENTS.md` and
`PROJECT_CONVENTIONS.md` at the project root.

Follow `PROJECT_CONVENTIONS.md` for every change. It is the canonical source
for the user-approved conventions and takes precedence over conflicting
generated template guidance. Do not duplicate or weaken these rules in
feature-specific instructions.

Before finishing, review the completed diff against its checklist. Report
blocked checks honestly; do not claim unperformed validation.

Do not refactor unrelated code solely to apply conventions.
